ilippe, take a vacation, give us a little break"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "We love you, we appreciate you, but it's time for a pause"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Come back with your genius when we least expect it"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And your music will make us laugh again, I know it well!"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}